        "_key": "mt02s",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "A turnkey clinic website takes **4 weeks** from brief to launch, from **£3,500**.",
          "**Week 1:** brief & structure · **2:** design · **3:** build & integrations · **4:** content, tests, launch",
          "Your involvement — about **5 hours** across the whole project",
          "We write the copy, utility pages are included, the price is fixed in the contract",
          "Online booking with a practice-system integration is in the base package"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt02t",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt02u",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What \"turnkey\" actually means"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt02v",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt02w",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "\"Turnkey\" is a worn-out word, so here it is literally. The price includes everything a working site needs: structure and copy, design, build, online booking, a practitioner directory, a price list, a CMS, domain, hosting, launch and a year of support. Not included: photography (we start with your photos and quality stock) and advertising. You don't write a spec or hunt for references — that's our job."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt02x",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt02y",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Week 1: brief and structure"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt02z",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt030",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "It starts with a 30-minute call: your clinic's arms, who your patients are, where enquiries come from today. Then we analyse 3–5 competitor clinics in your area and build the page map: home, services, practitioners, prices, contact — up to 8 pages in the base package. You get the structure to sign off. Your involvement: 1–2 hours."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt031",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt032",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Week 2: design"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt033",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt034",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The designer builds the home page and a typical service page layout. Medical specifics: a calm palette, real photos instead of stock, a prominent booking button on every screen, typography a 60+ audience can read. Two rounds of revisions included. Your involvement: about an hour of feedback."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt035",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt036",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Week 3: build and integrations"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt037",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "mt038",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The build, the CMS, and the thing that matters most for a clinic — online booking: service, practitioner and time slot in 2 clicks, an SMS confirmation for the patient, a notification for reception. We connect your practice management system or CRM. Load time — under 1.5 seconds on mobile. Your involvement: 0 hours."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "mt039",
        "_type": "blogImage",
        "alt": "A clinic receptionist handling an online booking at a computer",
