            "text": "We write the page copy (launch copywriting is included), load the price list and practitioners into the CMS, test booking and forms, and wire up Google Analytics and Search Console. The finale is a one-hour training session: after it, your practice manager updates fees and adds practitioners from a phone. Your involvement: 1–2 hours."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
